WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.100
When something goes wrong,

2
00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.310
you don't have time to unlock your phone,

3
00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:05.390
find a number,

4
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.550
and type a message.

5
00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:08.390
Every second matters.

6
00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:10.310
That's why there's LIMBUZZ.

7
00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:13.360
First, add the people you trust,

8
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.320
and choose your primary contact.

9
00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.390
Then give LIMBUZZ what it needs:

10
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:21.350
SMS, calls, notifications, your location,

11
00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:23.770
and, if you want, your microphone.

12
00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.860
And that's it. You're ready.

13
00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:29.300
If you're ever in danger, just press and hold.

14
00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:30.530
Three seconds.

15
00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:33.700
LIMBUZZ calls your primary contact, right away,

16
00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:38.590
and texts them your exact location, with a map link they can open in one tap.

17
00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:41.790
Every step shows live on your screen.

18
00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.280
When you're safe, end the emergency,

19
00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:46.050
and your contacts get a message:

20
00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:47.460
“I am safe now.”

21
00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.110
Every emergency is saved to your history:

22
00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:53.710
who was reached, what happened, and the audio recording.

23
00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:58.980
Core SOS actions work without internet, and your data stays on your phone.

24
00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:00.190
LIMBUZZ.

25
00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.090
Every second matters.
